      "excerpt": "PropTech Newarc Closes €800K Seed Investment Round Investor relations Governance Contact Us it en About us Investments Scouting Ticket Innovation The Hub - Events Portfolio People Content Hub News Press review About us Investments Scouting Ticket Innovation The Hub - Events Portfolio People Content Hub News Press review Investor relations Governance Contact Us NEWS PropTech Startup Newarc Closes €800K Seed Investment Round Accelerated by HabiSmart , the PropTech acceleration program of the CDP Venture Capital National Accelerator Network , managed by Zest . The startup develops AI-based digital services that streamline the processes of property buying, renovation, and enhancement. Newarc , a PropTech startup offering AI-powered digital services to facilitate property transactions, renovation, and enhancement, has closed a €800,000 seed investment round. The capital raise was subscribed by a group of business angels and the follow-on investment from the HabiSmart PropTech Accelerator of the CDP Venture Capital National Accelerator Network , with investors including the CDP Venture Capital Accelerator Fund , Zest , Nova Capital , and COIMA . Newarc: Revolutionizing Real Estate with AI Newarc simplifies and enhances real estate transactions through digital solutions and AI technologies, offering a range of services that cover the entire real estate value chain, aiming to maximize"
