      "url": "https://zestgroup.vc/en/blog/truescreen-secures-2-4-million-seed-round-investment",
      "page": "terms",
      "excerpt": "TrueScreen Secures €2.4 Million Seed Round Investment Investor relations Governance Contact Us it en About us Investments Scouting Ticket Innovation The Hub - Events Portfolio People Content Hub News Press review About us Investments Scouting Ticket Innovation The Hub - Events Portfolio People Content Hub News Press review Investor relations Governance Contact Us NEWS TrueScreen Secures €2.4 Million Seed Round Investment CYSERO EuVECA , Italy's only fund dedicated to cybersecurity, robotics, and AI, promoted by AVM Gestioni SGR S.p.A. (EuVECA Società Benefit Manager), in partnership with Kilometro Rosso , the Bergamo-based scientific and technological park, has led a €2.4 million seed round investment in TrueScreen . The cybersecurity company specializes in the acquisition, certification, and management of data with legal and evidentiary value. Recognized in 2023 by PwC Luxembourg as one of the five most promising global startups in cybersecurity, TrueScreen already serves major banks, insurance companies, and multinational organizations. Its technology ensures the authenticity and immutability of digital content such as photos, videos, screenshots, emails, signatures, and data streams. By providing legally binding and tamper-proof services, TrueScreen not only prevents data manipulation but also counters the creation of deepfakes enabled by AI. Alongside Cysero VC, the round"
